<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Fresenius Medical Care.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Fresenius Medical Care.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA says it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Fresenius Medical Care.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	04.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   DDF FFT		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  102.00 DEM</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	   ISS PRICE	PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL A	  100.00 DEM     20.00 DEM	17.70 PCT</p>
<p> CALL B	  120.00 DEM     12.00 DEM	29.90 PCT</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
